Upstream gVisor change, carried unchanged: the non-test part of commit
936ad90db on https://github.com/google/gvisor/pull/15019 (on top of
ed8a800c0c2d10916616ad2e0a791976fbd60274; fetched 2026-11-23), also in the
squashed https://github.com/google/gvisor/pull/17844. It keeps a duplicated
reopening SYN from drawing a reset. Apply after 01-forward-timewait-syn.patch.

Drop this patch once tailscale.com pins a gVisor that contains the change.

